    <h2>Platform Distribution</h2>
    <p>
      Fatalities were documented across six platforms, with notable variation in risk patterns. General-purpose AI assistants (ChatGPT, Meta AI, Gemini, DeepSeek) accounted for 32 fatalities, while dedicated companion chatbots (Character.AI, Chai AI) accounted for 3. Two platforms with significant user bases—Claude (Anthropic) and Replika—have zero documented deaths in this database. The database now includes both AI users who died (n=18) and third-party victims killed by AI users (n=17).
    </p>

